# Release preparation quarantine (2026-10-19).
# Only reviewed release-preparation documents are eligible initially.
# Existing source is NOT deleted. Replace with exact reviewed source exceptions
# after provenance/privacy review; this is NOT a runnable publication manifest.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/OPEN_SOURCE_AUDIT.md
!/LICENSE_RECOMMENDATION.md
!/CITATION.cff
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
!/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
!/GIT_OPERATIONS.md
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/CORE_LICENSE_REVIEW.md
!/docs/PERMISSION_REQUEST_DRAFT.md
!/docs/GPL_DISTRIBUTION_PLAN.md
!/docs/screenshots/
/docs/screenshots/*
!/docs/screenshots/README.md
!/examples/
/examples/*
!/examples/README.md
# Defense in depth when source directories are later admitted.
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv*/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/data/
**/patient_data/
**/raw_data/
**/DSA_data/
**/outputs/
**/output/
**/results/
**/cache/
**/temp/
**/tmp/
**/logs/
**/*.dcm
**/*.dicom
**/*.ima
**/*.nii
**/*.nii.gz
**/*.realm*
**/*.mat
**/*.asv
**/*.autosave
**/*~
**/*.m~
**/matlab.prf
**/matlabprefs.mat
**/javaclasspath.txt
**/pathdef.m
**/slprj/
**/codegen/
**/*.mex*
**/*.slxc
**/*.p
**/*.pyc
**/*.dll
**/*.exe
**/*.pyd
**/*.node
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.onnx
**/*.h5
**/*.hdf5
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
**/local_config.*
**/timeslice_current_rois.json
**/timeslice_roi_catalog.json
# Approved MAT templates require explicit per-file exceptions after inspection.
